# Coppercoat Vanguard gives each other Human you control ward {1}. Turn 2: Bot2's only mana is one Mountain, so its Lightning Bolt
# at Bot1's Dragon Sniper is countered by the ward trigger (it cannot pay {1}) and the Sniper takes no damage. Turn 4: with two Mountains
# it bolts the Vanguard itself, which has no ward (it is not "other"): the Bolt resolves with a Mountain untapped, killing the 2/2.
# CR 702.21a.

